meta {
  name: Share Bill
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/share-bill
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "channel": "EMAIL",
    "recipientType": "PATIENT",
    "toAddress": "patient@example.com"
  }
}

docs {
  "Share Bill" (single channel) from the Billings page: queue the order's bill PDF
  (the tenant's `accounts_biling` template) to the patient or referral panel over
  one deliverable channel, using the tenant's ACTIVATED `order_bill_as_attachment`
  messaging template for that channel.

  ## Body
  - `channel` (required) — `EMAIL` or `WHATSAPP` (both attach the PDF).
  - `recipientType` (required) — `PATIENT` or `PANEL` (the referral panel's
    Accounts Person).
  - `toAddress` (optional) — auto-filled, editable contact; omit to use the
    recipient's stored contact for the channel.

  ## Errors
  - 404 `ORDER_NOT_FOUND` — order missing / soft-deleted / other tenant.
  - 422 `SHARE_TEMPLATE_NOT_ACTIVATED` — no activated template for the channel.
  - 422 `SHARE_TEMPLATE_NOT_CONFIGURED` — WhatsApp template missing its approved id.
  - 400 `SHARE_RECIPIENT_MISSING` — no address/number for the chosen recipient.

  Prereqs: an activated `order_bill_as_attachment` messaging template (per channel)
  and an active `accounts_biling` PDF template so the bill can render.
}
